    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "From Adam to Abraham"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Adam, Seth, Enosh;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Kenan, Mahalalel, Jared;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Noah, Shem, Ham, and Japheth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Japheth: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, and Tiras."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Gomer: Ashkenaz, Riphath, and Togarmah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Javan: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, and Rodanim."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Ham: Cush, Egypt, Put, and Canaan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raamah, and Sabteca. The sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cush fathered Nimrod. He was the first on earth to be a mighty man."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Egypt fathered Ludim, Anamim, Lehabim, Naphtuhim,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Pathrusim, Casluhim (from whom the Philistines came), and Caphtorim."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Canaan fathered Sidon his firstborn and Heth,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and the Jebusites, the Amorites, the Girgashites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Hivites, the Arkites, the Sinites,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the Arvadites, the Zemarites, and the Hamathites."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Shem: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, and Aram. And the sons of Aram: Uz, Hul, Gether, and Meshech."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Arpachshad fathered Shelah, and Shelah fathered Eber."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "To Eber were born two sons: the name of the one was Peleg (for in his days the earth was divided), and his brother’s name was Joktan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Joktan fathered Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Obal, Abimael, Sheba,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ophir, Havilah, and Jobab; all these were the sons of Joktan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Shem, Arpachshad, Shelah;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Eber, Peleg, Reu;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Serug, Nahor, Terah;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abram, that is, Abraham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "From Abraham to Jacob"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Abraham: Isaac and Ishmael."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These are their genealogies: the firstborn of Ishmael, Nebaioth, and Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jetur, Naphish, and Kedemah. These are the sons of Ishmael."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Keturah, Abraham’s concubine: she bore Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. The sons of Jokshan: Sheba and Dedan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Midian: Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, and Eldaah. All these were the descendants of Keturah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abraham fathered Isaac. The sons of Isaac: Esau and Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Esau: Eliphaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam, and Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, Kenaz, and of Timna, Amalek."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Lotan: Hori and Hemam; and Lotan’s sister was Timna."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Shobal: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, and Onam. The sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The son of Anah: Dishon. The sons of Dishon: Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, and Cheran."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Ezer: Bilhan, Zaavan, and Akan. The sons of Dishan: Uz and Aran."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These are the kings who reigned in the land of Edom before any king reigned over the people of Israel: Bela the son of Beor, the name of his city being Dinhabah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          44
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Bela died, and Jobab the son of Zerah of Bozrah reigned in his place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          45
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jobab died, and Husham of the land of the Temanites reigned in his place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          46
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Husham died, and Hadad the son of Bedad, who defeated Midian in the country of Moab, reigned in his place, the name of his city being Avith."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          47
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hadad died, and Samlah of Masrekah reigned in his place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          48
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Samlah died, and Shaul of Rehoboth on the Euphrates reigned in his place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          49
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Shaul died, and Baal-hanan, the son of Achbor, reigned in his place."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          50
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Baal-hanan died, and Hadad reigned in his place, the name of his city being Pai; and his wife’s name was Mehetabel, the daughter of Matred, the daughter of Mezahab."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          51
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And Hadad died.",
          "The chiefs of Edom were: chiefs Timna, Alvah, Jetheth,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          52
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          53
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          54
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Magdiel, and Iram; these are the chiefs of Edom."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
